From: Shimazu <vanessimbolon2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:19:04 +0000
Subject: HooksHandler: Replace FoliaScheduler.runTaskLater with GlobalRegionScheduler

AE PATCH REASON: FoliaScheduler.runTaskLater delegation is incompatible with Folia region-threaded lifecycle; delayed faction hook registration must run on the global region scheduler. Lombok @Generated noise removed and raw ImmutableMap builder calls lack type safety.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace FoliaScheduler.runTaskLater with native Bukkit.getGlobalRegionScheduler().runDelayed. Remove FoliaScheduler and lombok.Generated imports, add ScheduledTask and Consumer imports. Add explicit type witness ImmutableMap.<HookPlugin, PluginHookInstance>builder() in three places. Remove @Generated annotation from getHolograms.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: FoliaScheduler → GlobalRegionScheduler. LOMBOK: @Generated removed. TY: explicit ImmutableMap generics. No behavior change.

